We pray that we would be filled with the Holy Spirit.

23
00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:21.020
We pray that you would take full control of areas of our

24
00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:25.040
heart and life that we never realized before we had kept

25
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:25.600
